  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『宇宙戦艦ヤマト 2202 愛の戦士たち』より、最終章で印象的だった次元潜航艦４隻がセットで登場！",
      "en": "From \"Space Battleship Yamato 2202 Warriors of Love\", the four dimensional submarines that were impressive in the final chapter are now available as a set!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 中央にヤマトをディスプレイすれば、４隻が連動してヤマトを異次元空間に潜航させ、都市帝国の中枢手前まで送り届けるシーンが再現できる。",
      "en": "• If you display Yamato in the center, you can recreate a scene where four ships work together to make Yamato dive into another dimension and deliver it to the center of the city empire."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 1/1000スケールならではの、ディテール、モールドを細部まで再現。",
      "en": "• Details and molds unique to 1/1000 Scale are reproduced down to the finest detail."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ディスプレイベースに貼れる艦名シール付き。",
      "en": "• Comes with a ship name seal that can be pasted on the display base."
    }
